<p>I hope this message finds you well. I'm Camielle from the Statefarm team at EverQuote, eager to discuss potential growth avenues as we head into the new year.</p>

<p>Exciting news! Effective January 1, 2024, EverQuote is offering subsidies for selective states, allowing us to provide incredible deals exclusively for our esteemed State Farm agents. But here's the kicker: even if your state isn't on the qualifying list, we've extended substantial discounts across the board, ensuring every agent can benefit from these tailored offerings. We also added some new states starting April 1st for subsidy so the future looks bright and we should be getting more in the future!</p>

<p>We've curated our current programs to cater to your agency's needs, presenting an array of discounted rates and fresh offerings that we're enthusiastic about.</p>

<p>I'm eager to chat further about these opportunities and how they can align with your agency's vision for growth. Could we schedule some time to discuss more?</p>

<p>Feel free to reach out to me directly at 732.219.1777.<br />
